  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_4658500237a9",
    "original": "<b>BUGS & TECHNICAL HELP</b> \r\n\n• If you find a bug please let us know via the bug reporter found through the pause menu or by pressing F8.\n\r\n• For technical help, please see our <u><link=https:\\/\\/steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1860884266>Troubleshooting Guide</link></u>.",
    "translation": "<b>漏洞和技术帮助</b> \r\n\n- 如果你发现了一个错误，请通过暂停菜单或按F8找到错误报告，让我们知道。\n\r\n- 关于技术帮助，请看我们的 <u><link=https:\\/\\/steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1860884266>故障排除指南</link></u>."
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_a9f84a98ce55",
