    "translation": "星级疯狂的探险家"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_b0fd1aa3f3b0",
    "original": "The Bittersweet Aria",
    "translation": "苦乐参半的咏叹调"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_32e92edf6977",
    "original": "The Rönnholm",
    "translation": "伦霍尔姆"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_e7e99742930a",
    "original": "\"Bring me my spear: O clouds unfold!\" A no-nonsense, common-or-garden armament for the skyfarer on a budget.\n\n<b>Damage: 10\nRange: 750\nHeat: 30</b>\n\nWeight: 10\n\n<color=#FFFFFF>Tier 1</color>",
    "translation": "\"给我带来我的长矛。哦，云层展开了！\"为预算有限的天空飞行者提供的无意义的、普通的或花园式的武装。\n\n<b>损害。10\n范围。750\n热量。攻击力：30</b>\n\n重量。10\n\n<color=#FFFFFF>层级1</color>"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_5f1cc79269b2",
    "original": "A wheezing, sputtering, ramshackle engine dating from the first days of London's settlement. It gobbles fuel like a starved wolf and sulks worse than a cat kept in from the rain. It will, at best, suffice.\n\nWeight: 30\n\n<b>Movement Speed:</b> 100%\n<b>Fuel Consumption:</b> 100%\n\n<color=#FFFFFF>Tier 1</color>",
    "translation": "一台喘息着、溅射着、破烂不堪的发动机，可以追溯到伦敦定居的最初几天。它像一只饥饿的狼一样狼吞虎咽，比一只被关在雨中的猫还闷闷不乐。它充其量也就够了。\n\n重量。30\n\n<b>移动速度。</b> 100%\n<b>燃料消耗。</b> 100%\n\n<color=#FFFFFF>层级1</color>"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_c42d88d79798",
    "original": "You cannot remove your engine. You could, however, replace it with another one.",
    "translation": "你不能拆除你的发动机。然而，你可以用另一个来替换它。"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_6a7d6a38f88d",
    "original": "Warning!",
    "translation": "警告!"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_b1faae1e42ba",
    "original": "Reputation: The Windward Company ({{A}})",
    "translation": "信誉。风华公司({{A}})"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_bd46af781be5",
    "original": "Reputation: The Tacketies ({{A}})",
    "translation": "信誉。Tacketies ({{A}})"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_4ac8e097a5b2",
    "original": "Fermented ({{A}})",
    "translation": "发酵的 ({{A}})"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_91b1af492d94",
    "original": "Flickering ({{A}})",
    "translation": "闪闪发光 ({{A}})"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_f5a49d22ffc7",
    "original": "Your Train",
    "translation": "你的火车"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_63c6fa3d3f4c",
    "original": "It is impressive that their engine lasted as long as it did. They must have good reflexes, at least.\n\n<b>Effects: </b><b><color=#83d978FF>+2 Hearts</color></b> | <b><color=#83d978FF>+6 Iron</color></b> | <b><color=#83d978FF>+1 Affiliation: Establishment</color></b>",
    "translation": "令人印象深刻的是，他们的引擎持续了那么久。他们至少必须有良好的反应能力。\n\n<b>影响。 </b><b><color=#83d978FF>+2心脏</color></b> | <b><color=#83d978FF>+6 铁</color></b> | <b><color=#83d978FF>+1附属机构。成立时间</color></b>"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_e812ea42fbfb",
    "original": "Fastidious Inspector ({{A}})",
    "translation": "一丝不苟的视察员 ({{A}})"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_b10ca6276853",
    "original": "Black Box ({{A}})",
    "translation": "黑匣子 ({{A}})"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_f1d1987d8b2d",
    "original": "An Inspector of London's Horological Office – responsible for the orderly regulation of time across the empire – requires assistance. You are to escort her to Port Prosper. Prosper lies to the south-southeast of New Winchester.",
    "translation": "伦敦钟表局的一名视察员--负责整个帝国的时间秩序管理--需要协助。你要护送她到普罗斯波港。普罗斯珀位于新温彻斯特的东南偏南。"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_1f2a959910da",
    "original": "<b><color=#FDBD58FF><smallcaps>New Winchester</smallcaps></color></b>\n<color=#FFFFFFFF>The greatest port in the Reach, fought over by the independent Tacketies and the London-loyalist Stovepipes.</color>\n<color=#D0D0D0FF><i>This port sells </i></color><b><color=#FFFFFF>fuel</color></b><color=#D0D0D0FF><i> and </i></color><b><color=#FFFFFF>supplies</color></b><color=#D0D0D0FF><i>.</i></color>",
    "translation": "<b><color=#FDBD58FF><smallcaps>新温彻斯特</smallcaps></color></b>\n<color=#FFFFFFFF>Reach地区最大的港口，由独立的Tacketies和忠于伦敦的Stovepipes争夺。</color>\n<color=#D0D0D0FF><i>这个港口的销售 </i></color><b><color=#FFFFFF>燃料</color></b><color=#D0D0D0FF><i> 和 </i></color><b><color=#FFFFFF>补给品</color></b><color=#D0D0D0FF><i>.</i></color>"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_00b575e8b75f",
    "original": "Affiliation: Villainy ({{A}})",
    "translation": "隶属关系。小人({{A}})"
  },
