    "translation": "太阳的力量 ({{A}})"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_4d1c3144cd5f",
    "original": "The <i>Orphean</i> (completed)",
    "translation": "最近，<i>俄耳甫斯号</i> (已完成)"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_b4f9be565581",
    "original": "With extra fold-down bunks and some careful shift-scheduling, you can squeeze a few more in. It will be snug, but that keeps the cold at bay.\n\n<b>Effects: </b><b><color=#83d978FF>+4 Quarters</color></b> | \n\nWeight: 10\n\n<b>Requires: </b><color=#FA2827>Veils at 25+</color>\n<color=#5CFE51>Tier 2</color>",
    "translation": "有了额外的折叠式床铺和一些仔细的轮班安排，你可以多挤几个人进去。这将是很舒适的，但这可以防止寒冷。\n\n<b>影响。 </b><b><color=#83d978FF>+4宿舍</color></b> |\n\n重量。秤砣: 10\n\n<b>需要。 </b><color=#FA2827>25+的面纱</color>\n<color=#5CFE51>层级2</color>"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_c6e262be3da4",
    "original": "\"Why should Punishment Weave the Veil with Iron Wheels of War\" A short-range, rapid-firing gun capable of quick turn arounds. Beloved by the short-tempered and the short-sighted.\r\n\n\n<b>Damage: 5\nRange: 650\nHeat: 8</b>\n\nWeight: 10\n\n<b>Requires: </b><color=#FA2827>Veils at 25+</color>\n<color=#5CFE51>Tier 2</color>",
    "translation": "\"惩罚为什么要用战争的铁轮来编织面纱\"，一种能够快速转身的短程速射炮。受到脾气暴躁和目光短浅的人的喜爱。\r\n\n\n<b>损害。5\n范围。650\n热量。攻击力：8</b>\n\n重量。10\n\n<b>需要。 </b><color=#FA2827>25+的面纱</color>\n<color=#5CFE51>层级2</color>"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_9be4cf113222",
    "original": "\"The strong shall be as tow, and the maker of it as a spark, and they shall both burn together, and none shall quench them.\" A long-range, fast-firing, self-cooling armament for the captain who likes things settled promptly. The barrel revolves, possibly powered by spite.\n\n<b>Damage: 15\nRange: 750\nHeat: 25</b>\n\nWeight: 10\n\n<b>Requires: </b><color=#FA2827>Mirrors at 25+</color>\n<color=#5CFE51>Tier 2</color>",
    "translation": "\"强者如塔，造者如火，二者同烧，谁也不能熄灭。\"一种远程、快速发射、自冷却的武器，适合喜欢迅速解决事情的船长。炮管旋转，可能是由怨气驱动。\n\n<b>损害。15\n范围。750\n热量。攻击力：25</b>\n\n重量。10\n\n<b>需要。 </b><color=#FA2827>25+的镜子</color>\n<color=#5CFE51>层级2</color>"
  },
  {
    "key": "ui_runtime_1b7cdbf08dd5",
    "original": "\"The secret of success in life is to be ready for opportunity when it comes.\" A mine favoured by captains eager to bedevil pursuit.\n\n<b>Damage: 10\nBlast Damage: 10\nRange: 750\nHeat: 35</b>\n\nWeight: 10\n\n<b>Requires: </b><color=#A7FDA2>Iron at 25+</color>\n<color=#5CFE51>Tier 2</color>",
    "translation": "\"生活中成功的秘诀是在机会来临时做好准备\"。渴望寝食难安的船长们所青睐的地雷。\n\n<b>损害。10\n爆炸伤害。10\n范围。攻击范围：750\n热量。35</b>\n\n重量。10\n\n<b>需要。 </b><color=#A7FDA2>在25+的铁</color>\n<color=#5CFE51>层级2</color>"
  },
